    "body": "Thank you for this clear proposal.\n\nTriage: **P6** (accepted enhancement), **effort:high**, **area:ui**, **area:mcp**. It adds data to the project file, a re-import path and an MCP tool, so it needs a project-file version step and its migration test. Your rule that a changed file never regenerates or posts by itself keeps it safe.\n\nIf you take it on, please comment `claimed:` with your plan, as on #2462.\n",
